/// Filters an input collection of text items to exclude any entries that contain the sequence "ab".
/// 
/// This function uses a sliding window approach for efficient substring detection
/// without allocating additional strings for each comparison.
/// 
/// # Arguments
/// * `items` - A slice of string slices to filter
/// 
/// # Returns
/// * `Vec<&str>` - A vector containing only the items that do NOT contain "ab"
