    let positions = first_occurrence_positions(input_list);
    println!("{:?}", positions);
}
```

In this version, we use a `HashMap` to store the first occurrence of each element. The `or_insert` method inserts the current position into the map if the element is not already present, and returns the stored position. This results in a linear time complexity.

