/// * `x_end` - End of the x-interval [var0, var1]
/// * `y_start` - Start of the y-interval [var2, var3]
/// * `y_end` - End of the y-interval [var2, var3]
/// * `x_steps` - Number of steps in the x-direction (inclusive)
/// * `y_steps` - Number of steps in the y-direction (inclusive)
