/// # Arguments
/// * `df0` - Input DataFrame
/// * `str0` - Name of the first column to use for the outer index level
/// * `str1` - Name of the second column to use for the inner index level
///
/// # Returns
/// * `Result<DataFrame>` - DataFrame with hierarchical index, or an error
///
/// # Example
/// ```rust
