```
Original map:
  fruits: [3, 1, 5, 2] (max: 5)
  colors: [10, 8, 9] (max: 10)
  animals: [7, 4, 6] (max: 7)
  numbers: [2, 15, 3] (max: 15)

Sorted by max value (descending):
  numbers: [2, 15, 3] (max: 15)
  colors: [10, 8, 9] (max: 10)
