/// Resets the row index of a DataFrame and converts the existing index values into new columns.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `df` - Input DataFrame with an existing index
///
/// # Returns
/// A new DataFrame with:
/// - Reset row index (0, 1, 2, ...)
/// - Original index values as new columns
///
/// # Example
/// ```
