- V must implement AsRef<[T]> (so the values can be slices/Vecs/arrays).
- T must be Ord + Clone (so we can use the element as the sort key).
- You can choose whether "missing" values (sequences shorter than idx) come first or last via missing_first.
- When the element exists for both entries, ordering uses T's Ord. Missing values are compared using Option<T> semantics.

