/// Extracts key-value pairs from the provided `IndexMap` where the keys contain the specified sequence.
///
/// # Arguments
///
/// * `map` - A reference to an `IndexMap` containing the associative mapping.
/// * `sequence` - A string slice representing the sequence to search for in the keys.
///
