- Struct column: unnest expands the struct fields into separate columns.
- List column: extracts the 0-th and 1-st elements of each list into two new columns.

Note: this code assumes you have a recent polars crate (polars 0.28+ / 0.29+; any modern 2023+ release should work). Add polars to your Cargo.toml (for example: polars = "0.29").

