/// Groups columns of a 2D table by their labels and computes the sum of values in each group.
///
/// # Arguments
/// * `data` - A 2D vector of f64 values (rows x columns)
/// * `column_labels` - A vector of string labels for each column
///
/// # Returns
/// * A HashMap where keys are column labels and values are the sum of all values in columns with that label
///
/// # Example
/// ```
/// use std::collections::HashMap;
///
